{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar","id":1068910,"title":"Moana Is Such a Solar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-27T15:42:25-07:00","id":1068910,"title":"Moana Is Such a Solar","content":"I watched Moana tonight, so this kind of just happened. I needed to do <i>something</i>.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Name:</b> Moana<br /> <b>Caste:</b> Eclipse<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Wayfinder Chieftain<br /> <b>Supernal Ability:</b> Sail<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> <br /> Strength \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Dexterity \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Stamina \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> <br /> Charisma \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Manipulation \u2022\u2022<br /> Appearance \u2022\u2022<br /> <br /> Perception \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Intelligence \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Wits \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> <br /> <b>Abilities</b><br /> <br /> [_] Archery<br /> [F] Athletics \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Awareness \u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Brawl \u2022<br /> [C] Bureaucracy \u2022<br /> [_] Craft \u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Dodge<br /> [F] Integrity \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Investigation<br /> [_] Larceny<br /> [_] Linguistics<br /> [_] Lore (History) \u2022\u2022 (The History of Her People +1)<br /> [_] Martial Arts<br /> [_] Medicine<br /> [_] Melee \u2022 (Against Coconuts +1)<br /> [C] Occult \u2022<br /> [F] Performance \u2022\u2022 (Traditional Dances and Rituals +1)<br /> [C] Presence \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> [F] Resistance \u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Ride<br /> [C] Sail \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> [C] Socialize \u2022\u2022<br /> [_] Stealth<br /> [F] Survival \u2022\u2022 (On the Sea +1)<br /> [_] Thown \u2022<br /> [_] War<br /> <br /> <b>Intimacies</b><br /> The Line Where the Sky Meets the Sea (Relentless Fascination) (Defining Tie)<br /> &quot;I am Moana of Motunui. Aboard my boat, I will sail across the sea and restore the heart of Te Fiti.&quot; (Major Principle)<br /> The People of Motunui (Responsibility to Protect) (Major Tie)<br /> The Curse of Te Fiti (Disgust) (Minor Tie)<br /> <br /> <b>Merits</b><br /> Allies \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Maui)<br /> Direction Sense \u2022<br /> Familiar \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Literally the Entire Ocean)<br /> Followers \u2022\u2022\u2022 (The People of Motunui)<br /> Language \u2022 (Old Realm)<br /> Strong Lungs \u2022<br /> <br /> <b>Charms</b><br /> <br /> <b>Limit Break:</b> [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_]<br /> <b>Limit Trigger:</b> The Solar suffers a setback or defeat because of a mistake she made.<br /> <br /> <b>Willpower</b> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022\u2022 [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_] [_]<br /> <br /> <b>Essence</b> \u2022<br /> <b>Personal:</b> 13/13<br /> <b>Peripheral:</b> 33/33<br /> <b>Committed:</b> 0<br /> <br /> <b>Weapons</b><br /> Oar (Medium mortal melee weapon, Bashing, Melee, Smashing, Improvised)<br /> <br /> <b>Health and Defenses</b><br /> <br /> <b>Health levels:</b><br /> -0: [_]<br /> -1: [_] [_]<br /> -2: [_] [_]<br /> -4: [_]<br /> Inc: [_]<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Parry (with Oar):</b> 3<br /> <b>Evasion:</b> 2<br /> <b>Resolve:</b> 4<br /> <b>Guile:</b> 2<br /> <b>Rush:</b> 5<br /> <b>Disengage:</b> 3<br /> <b>Join Battle:</b> 6<br /> <br /> <b>Natural Soak:</b> 2<br /> <b>Armour:</b> None<br /> <b>Final Soak:</b> 2<br /> <br /> <b>Inventory</b><br /> The Heart of Te Fiti<br /> A sturdy boat (Speed: Current +1, Sail +2; Manuverability +2; Hull: -2/-4/Inc; Cargo: Supplies for one or two people for a few days.)<br /> The world's most useless chicken (except that one time)<br /> <br /> <b>Experience</b><br /> <b>Current:</b> 0<br /> <b>Total:</b> 0<br /> <br /> <b>Solar Experience</b><br /> <b>Current:</b> 0<br /> <b>Total:</b> 0</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I was going to add Charms as well, but I realized I have no where near the system knowledge I had for 2e these days, and I'm not spending another hour on this now. I also only spent one of her Bonus Points. I might do it later. I'm also open to suggestions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 03-29-2017, 09:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T15:51:25-07:00","id":1068913,"title":"","content":"This is obviously her at the end of the movie. I'll go flip through the charms and make some suggestions later.<br /> <br /> ...Also, she has 13 caste/favored abilities. I'd suggest dropping Occult, Linguistics, and Ride.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T18:16:08-07:00","id":1068958,"title":"","content":"See, I'd actually see Moana as an Extigent of the Ocean Father, given a quest to shake Maui (who should go down as one of the most Lunar Lunars that ever Lunar'd).out of his current sulk, in order to fucking apologize to one of the few jouten of Gaia that's still present in Creation.<br /> <br /> &gt;.&gt;<br /> <br /> Not that I've been thinking about this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T21:57:14-07:00","id":1069072,"title":"","content":"I like the Ocean Exigent idea, however, I totally agree with the Eclipse approach. It feels the most right to me, with the Ocean as a powerful Ally - she is all about connecting people and forging new paths, which feels like the heart of what the Eclipse are about.<br /> I totally agree that Maui is the most Lunar that ever Lunar'd - everything about him screamed a burly Changing Moon who lost his nerve.<br /> <br /> I really need to do a true ocean themed game someday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/798-joshua","name":"Joshua","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar798_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T11:17:30-07:00","id":1069486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joshua</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069072#post1069072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really need to do a true ocean themed game someday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Believe me, there's good times to be had there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T11:30:22-07:00","id":1069497,"title":"","content":"I don't really see Moana as a Solar, a prime candidate to become a Solar certainly if she lived in Creation, but her narrative in the movie is more that of a heroic mortal caught up in a journey beyond that is beyond her scope.<br /> <br /> Now Maui is a elder Lunar for sure, master shape-shifter, magical tattoos, regularly goes out and beats up primordial monsters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T11:37:39-07:00","id":1069506,"title":"","content":"Only &quot;elder&quot; in the sense of having sat on an island for a thousand years without having done anything. Fighting big ghoulies is not unique to Essence 6+ characters.<br /> <br /> (Indeed, a pair of Essence 3 PCs took on a giant crab about the same size as Tamatoa in my game and handled her pretty well.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-28-2017, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T12:22:16-07:00","id":1069537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069506#post1069506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Only &quot;elder&quot; in the sense of having sat on an island for a thousand years without having done anything. Fighting big ghoulies is not unique to Essence 6+ characters.<br /> <br /> (Indeed, a pair of Essence 3 PCs took on a giant crab about the same size as Tamatoa in my game and handled her pretty well.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Just elder in the sense that he was there for and played an integral part in the creation of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T12:30:49-07:00","id":1069540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069537#post1069537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just elder in the sense that he was there for and played an integral part in the creation of the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was just hedging against the possibility of the distressingly-common notion of &quot;Elder = Essence 6+.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T12:44:30-07:00","id":1069549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1068958#post1068958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maui (who should go down as one of the most Lunar Lunars that ever Lunar'd)</div> </div> </div> </div>Quoted for truth.<br /> <br /> Y'know I heard a rumor that apparently &quot;You're Welcome&quot; was written after The Rock had been cast as Maui, since Lin-Manuel Miranda figured that if ANYBODY could sing such a cocky ego-stroking song and make people think 'Wow I really SHOULD be thanking that guy' it'd be The Rock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T13:55:56-07:00","id":1069599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1068913#post1068913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is obviously her at the end of the movie. I'll go flip through the charms and make some suggestions later.<br /> <br /> ...Also, she has 13 caste/favored abilities. I'd suggest dropping Occult, Linguistics, and Ride.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoops. Thanks. Set that straight. I also spent the rest of the bonus points, but still no Charms.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joshua</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069072#post1069072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the Ocean Exigent idea, however, I totally agree with the Eclipse approach. It feels the most right to me, with the Ocean as a powerful Ally - she is all about connecting people and forging new paths, which feels like the heart of what the Eclipse are about.<br /> I totally agree that Maui is the most Lunar that ever Lunar'd - everything about him screamed a burly Changing Moon who lost his nerve.<br /> <br /> I really need to do a true ocean themed game someday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, her whole story is about empathy: from when she saved the little turtle on the beach when she was a kid, to helping Maui get back on track, to seeing the pain Te Fiti was in. That's why the ocean chose her; it needed someone who could see Te Fiti in Te K\u0101 and understand her situation.<br /> <br /> Edit: I should say, though, that I don't think Moana is better than Frozen or Zootopia for me. It has its points, like the admittedly gorgeous animation, the focus on navigation and the entirely non-romantic story line. But Frozen was different; it broke the pattern of rejection from and re-acceptance into society that is so common in children's movies. Zootopia dealt with social issues on a thorough level while never losing sight of the characters. Moana... it's the standard Hollywood hero's journey. And sure, it works, and I like it because I know it, but it lacks that edge.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069497#post1069497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't really see Moana as a Solar, a prime candidate to become a Solar certainly if she lived in Creation, but her narrative in the movie is more that of a heroic mortal caught up in a journey beyond that is beyond her scope.<br /> <br /> Now Maui is a elder Lunar for sure, master shape-shifter, magical tattoos, regularly goes out and beats up primordial monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div>But I mean, she kind of makes it her scope in the end, right? My thought is that at some point on the way, she Exalted. Perhaps when she takes up the Heart of Te Fiti after having given it away, or when the sea parts and she stands before Te K\u0101. The fact that she doesn't beat anything up (except coconuts) doesn't disqualify her from Exaltation, in my mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 03-28-2017, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T14:52:28-07:00","id":1069641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069599#post1069599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I mean, she kind of makes it her scope in the end, right? My thought is that at some point on the way, she Exalted. Perhaps when she takes up the Heart of Te Fiti after having given it away, or when the sea parts and she stands before Te K\u0101. The fact that she doesn't beat anything up (except coconuts) doesn't disqualify her from Exaltation, in my mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>She definitely becomes more skilled and confident as the movie progresses to her confronting Te K\u0101 on her own, but I wouldn't say she ever attains that sort of supernatural arete that a Solar has. I didn't see it being skill or prowess that saves her in the end so much as pure determination. Moana totally tracks on the same heroic path that would create a Solar, I just don't think her ability tracks anywhere near a Solar's, the closest mechanical representation of her would still be a Heroic Mortal IMO.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T16:03:58-07:00","id":1069684,"title":"","content":"I think she really fits as a newly-Exalted Eclipse, especially in 3e where Essence 1 Solar Charms are more &quot;uncannily-effective expressions of normal human skill&quot; than superhuman powers that utterly remove the Solar from the realm of human concerns. Moana regularly makes jumps that would be near-certain death for ordinary people, sails the span of the ocean on a flimsy catamaran, and survives her voyage on a mere armful of provisions - all feats that would be impressive achievements for grizzled mariners twice her age, to say nothing of keeping <i>Maui </i>on-task when the gods themselves had given up. Give her a handful of Spirit Charms from the Ocean itself, and it tracks.<br /> <br /> Also, IMO, it's not that Moana is in any way <i>lacking </i>so much that Zootopia was fucking incredible - lightning in a bottle, and any sequel in the works has a hell of a high bar to clear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus","name":"Thesaurasaurus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T17:39:36-07:00","id":1069738,"title":"","content":"I realize that you outright say it's an opinion, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1024\" data-vbnamecard=\"1024\">Thesaurasaurus</a> , but my experience was the opposite - <i>Moana</i> was great, and <i>Zootopia</i> got into <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scientific_racism\" target=\"_blank\">some really uncomfortable territory</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T18:12:17-07:00","id":1069752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069738#post1069738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I realize that you outright say it's an opinion, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1024\" data-vbnamecard=\"1024\">Thesaurasaurus</a> , but my experience was the opposite - <i>Moana</i> was great, and <i>Zootopia</i> got into <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scientific_racism\" target=\"_blank\">some really uncomfortable territory</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>But...it's specifically a <i>repudiation </i>of that...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus","name":"Thesaurasaurus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T19:03:33-07:00","id":1069772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thesaurasaurus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069752#post1069752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But...it's specifically a <i>repudiation </i>of that...</div> </div> </div> </div>In what way? How does a movie that depicts ethnicities as <a href=\"https://muse.jhu.edu/article/368551\" target=\"_blank\">different species of animal</a> stand as a specific <b>rejection</b> of scientific racism?<br /> <br /> It's hard to accept the notion that the movie <i>isn't</i> embracing the principles when it starts off by telling us how this minority group <i>factually</i> used to be uncivilized and violent (<a href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=EK7Br9p2f-Q\" target=\"_blank\">and even today, are only fit to join civilized society</a> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=mnnVhvhHeNs\" target=\"_blank\">by way of spending years wearing shock collars</a>).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-28-2017, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T19:22:32-07:00","id":1069785,"title":"","content":"The shock collars were in an earlier cut of the movie, they realized it hurt the message in the long run.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","name":"MuscaDomestica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T19:39:25-07:00","id":1069795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MuscaDomestica</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069785#post1069785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The shock collars were in an earlier cut of the movie, they realized it hurt the message in the long run.</div> </div> </div> </div>Taking the shock collars back out doesn't remove the problem - <a href=\"http://www.newsweek.com/there-no-such-thing-race-283123\" target=\"_blank\">real-world race has no basis in biology</a>, and this is a movie where the filmmakers spent almost two hours saying otherwise.<br /> <br /> Hoo, boy, that went off-topic. My apologies, all.<br /> <br /> <i>Buuuuuuuut</i> back on the subject of <i>Moana</i>\u2026<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thesaurasaurus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069684#post1069684\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Moana\u2026 sails the span of the ocean on a flimsy catamaran, and survives her voyage on a mere armful of provisions - all feats that would be impressive achievements for grizzled mariners twice her age\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind, we don't know how far she sailed, but her real-world counterparts went thousands of miles reliably enough for us to find evidence of their presence in the Americas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-28-2017, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T20:48:57-07:00","id":1069839,"title":"","content":"It's fair to say the struggles presented in Zootopia are reflective of the struggles we find ourselves dealing with in America today, largely mistrust based on differences of race, but I don't see any examples of species in Zootopia representing real world ethnicities. I don't see where you're drawing that from.<br /> <br /> Anyhoo, I could potentially see Moana as an Eclipse caste. She does become a &quot;master&quot; wayfinder awfully quickly, and bringing wayfinding back to her people after a thousand years is a pretty Exalted-y feat. I could just as easily see her as an Exigent, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/48-deraforia","name":"deraforia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T23:40:03-07:00","id":1069909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>deraforia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069839#post1069839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's fair to say the struggles presented in Zootopia are reflective of the struggles we find ourselves dealing with in America today\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Um, I don't think it <i>should</i> be. Which is what I was complaining about. There's actual biological components to the discrimination in <i>Zootopia</i>, where real-world racism has no basis in real science! And by presenting it as reflective of racism, <i>it lends validity to &quot;scientific&quot; racism</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>deraforia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069839#post1069839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see any examples of species in Zootopia representing real world ethnicities. I don't see where you're drawing that from.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did we watch the same movie? Having white people up and touch your hair out of nowhere is a <i>distressingly</i> common experience from black people I've talked to. Likewise Judy being upset over being called &quot;cute&quot; draws parallels with many instances of real-world racial slurs.<br /> <br /> That said, if you really care to continue discussing this, can I ask we move the Zootopia stuff elsewhere?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-29-2017, 02:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T04:14:27-07:00","id":1069962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069549#post1069549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Y'know I heard a rumor that apparently &quot;You're Welcome&quot; was written after The Rock had been cast as Maui, since Lin-Manuel Miranda figured that if ANYBODY could sing such a cocky ego-stroking song and make people think 'Wow I really SHOULD be thanking that guy' it'd be The Rock.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI heard a rumour that it was something that Miranda was singing to himself while imagining a crowd of Hamilton fans when some of the producers happened upon him and assumed that it was for Moana, and he had to save face by not denying it.<br /> <br /> \u200bIt is a rumour that I started.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T04:17:21-07:00","id":1069964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069497#post1069497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't really see Moana as a Solar, a prime candidate to become a Solar certainly if she lived in Creation, but her narrative in the movie is more that of a heroic mortal caught up in a journey beyond that is beyond her scope.</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you see Moana's primary skills as?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T05:04:20-07:00","id":1069982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069497#post1069497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't really see Moana as a Solar, a prime candidate to become a Solar certainly if she lived in Creation, but her narrative in the movie is more that of a heroic mortal caught up in a journey beyond that is beyond her scope.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are being picky without need.<br /> That story is also one of the exact prime stories for exalting as a solar.<br /> That she succeeded against quite literally primordial odds only reinforces that.<br /> That she did what the gods and monsters couldn't reinforces that.<br /> <br /> You'll <i>never</i> have a very clear cut difference between heroic mortal and solar in a medium that doesn't use explicitly those terms, by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":32,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","user":"Synapse","date":". 03-29-2017, 08:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T05:40:44-07:00","id":1069995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069641#post1069641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She definitely becomes more skilled and confident as the movie progresses to her confronting Te K\u0101 on her own, but I wouldn't say she ever attains that sort of supernatural arete that a Solar has. I didn't see it being skill or prowess that saves her in the end so much as pure determination. Moana totally tracks on the same heroic path that would create a Solar, I just don't think her ability tracks anywhere near a Solar's, the closest mechanical representation of her would still be a Heroic Mortal IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I can see that too. I might try to build her a mortal as well, see how that turns out.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0g29Wg4oyek\" target=\"_blank\">On a tangent, here's Moana if she had <s>Linguistics 5</s> a whole bunch of Language Merits, or was a 2e character I guess.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 03-29-2017, 09:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:01:55-07:00","id":1070005,"title":"","content":"Linguistics is no longer tied to number of languages spoken - that's a Merit, now.<br /> <br /> (Incidentally, I've seen it before, and it's great. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Is it weird that I knew the exact video you'd linked before I clicked?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:10:06-07:00","id":1070008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070005#post1070005\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Linguistics is no longer tied to number of languages spoken - that's a Merit, now.<br /> <br /> (Incidentally, I've seen it before, and it's great. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Is it weird that I knew the exact video you'd linked before I clicked?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn, I forget. But I love it. I loved the multilingual Let It Go too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:29:34-07:00","id":1070013,"title":"","content":"Loads of characters are great Solar inspiration without being Solars in power or capability. Conan for example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:29:47-07:00","id":1070014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1069964#post1069964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What do you see Moana's primary skills as?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm, certainly Sail and Bureaucracy (her father has taught her how to run the village), with a side of perhaps Athletics to help her on her adventures and Lore which she learned from the Elder. I can't decide If she would have Performance (Singing) or not. I guess you have to decide if being part of a musical means you need performance, being able to sing is more like a meta-construct of the story not the character If I had to decide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:39:49-07:00","id":1070019,"title":"","content":"There should probably be something there in how the climax involves her resolving the main conflict through a show of empathy and healing.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm torn on Bureaucracy; on one hand, it's described as an ability for organizational endeavours, but on the other it doesn't entirely feel evident in such a small and interdependent community.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:53:59-07:00","id":1070024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070013#post1070013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Loads of characters are great Solar inspiration without being Solars in power or capability. Conan for example.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't diagree with you there, Moana and Conan are great pre-exaltation Solar inspiration. What I have been trying to point out is their stories would have played out very differently had they actually Exalted.<br /> <br /> Heroic narratives for Mortals and Exalt power level characters work in different ways. Like take another good example of Exalted inspiration Fate/Stay UBW, Shirou and Arturia are both heroes but the difference in their power levels mean they approch problems differently. I would say Moana is closer to Shirou, except she never gets an &quot;exaltation&quot; moment like when he beats Gilgamesh. There is never that sea change swing in power that is crucial to being a Solar, though I'm sure it would have happened sailing back to face Te K\u0101 had she been in Creation and the sort of narrative where that gain of power wouldn't have made Maui obsolete to the finale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T06:55:31-07:00","id":1070025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070019#post1070019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There should probably be something there in how the climax involves her resolving the main conflict through a show of empathy and healing.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm torn on Bureaucracy; on one hand, it's described as an ability for organizational endeavours, but on the other it doesn't entirely feel evident in such a small and interdependent community.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They are organized enough you can tell someone good at it from someone bad at it. That should be enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T07:01:23-07:00","id":1070027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070019#post1070019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There should probably be something there in how the climax involves her resolving the main conflict through a show of empathy and healing.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm torn on Bureaucracy; on one hand, it's described as an ability for organizational endeavours, but on the other it doesn't entirely feel evident in such a small and interdependent community.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I went to bureaucracy instead of presence because the scope of her leading the village seemed very &quot;mayoral&quot;, concerned with planning and stuff like moving Palm trees and attending functions.<br /> <br /> You have also made me realize that I dont know if empathy is well represented in Solar charms, you get a bit of it in both Presence and Socialize, but I would say it is not so much framed as emotional sympathy as much as calculated emotional analysis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T07:05:13-07:00","id":1070028,"title":"","content":"I'd argue that Conan's a pretty decent Solar with Resistance Supernal.<br /> <br /> (As for Moana, I'd rank Performance over Bureaucracy.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T07:05:30-07:00","id":1070029,"title":"","content":"SpruceStripedGoose, you're losing yourself in the Scale problem.<br /> No media other than exalted will ever really convey itself smoothly to exalted's scale. It'll be all over the place, even within different characters of the same story.<br /> That's what I referred to when I said you'll never have a good way to differentiate heroic mortal from solar when adapting a story. The easiest would require comparing in-setting characters of similar nature, like moana and her people. Considering she's comparatively the top dog in anything she set out to do and her will and work quite literally changed her people forever, pegging her as a solar fits quite nicely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't diagree with you there, Moana and Conan are great pre-exaltation Solar inspiration. What I have been trying to point out is their stories would have played out very differently had they actually Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would it? She overcame the challenges set before her. That's a quite strong hallmark of how exalts work. Especially when she's setting precedent.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heroic narratives for Mortals and Exalt power level characters work in different ways.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>In Exalted</b>.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Like take another good example of Exalted inspiration Fate/Stay UBW, Shirou and Arturia are both heroes but the difference in their power levels mean they approch problems differently. I would say Moana is closer to Shirou, except she never gets an &quot;exaltation&quot; moment like when he beats Gilgamesh. There is never that sea change swing in power that is crucial to being a Solar,</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, <b>in exalted</b>. The movie Moana does not follow Exalted's rules. You're worrying too much about details that don't need to apply to give her the title.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> though I'm sure it would have happened sailing back to face Te K\u0101 had she been in Creation and the sort of narrative where that gain of power wouldn't have made Maui obsolete to the finale.</div> </div> </div> </div>You seriously think Lunar!Maui would be made obsolete by Moana exalting mid-crisis?<br /> Please, sir. You are talking about a <i>lunar</i>. An <i>exalt</i>. Show some respect.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T07:06:27-07:00","id":1070031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is never that sea change swing in power that is crucial to being a Solar</div> </div> </div> </div>Nobody outside of Exalted is a Solar.<br /> <br /> \u200bWhat Moana is is a person who goes out into a world filled with supernatural dangers and stands equal to them, which is the kind of narrative that created the game.<br /> <br /> The Founding Fathers of the United States don't have the kind of moment you're describing here, and yet their status as culture heroes in a national foundation myth also covers certain narrative details that are in the DNA of Solars.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T07:08:55-07:00","id":1070036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that gain of power wouldn't have made Maui obsolete to the finale.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bIn your description of Moana's primary skills, you don't mention fighting anywhere.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T15:55:16-07:00","id":1070357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070024#post1070024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can't diagree with you there, Moana and Conan are great pre-exaltation Solar inspiration. What I have been trying to point out is their stories would have played out very differently had they actually Exalted.<br /> <br /> Heroic narratives for Mortals and Exalt power level characters work in different ways. Like take another good example of Exalted inspiration Fate/Stay UBW, Shirou and Arturia are both heroes but the difference in their power levels mean they approch problems differently. I would say Moana is closer to Shirou, except she never gets an &quot;exaltation&quot; moment like when he beats Gilgamesh. There is never that sea change swing in power that is crucial to being a Solar, though I'm sure it would have happened sailing back to face Te K\u0101 had she been in Creation and the sort of narrative where that gain of power wouldn't have made Maui obsolete to the finale.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say they are perfectly good examples of inspiration for actual Solars too, not just Solars pre-exaltation. Power levels are not really that important to inspiration, what matters is theme and feel. Conan feels like if he was in Creation he would be a Solar Exalted as he is, and yeah maybe he'd be more powerful, but at the end of the day, he'd embody the same themes of a hard-bitten and supremely capable warrior-thief, who is made King by his own hand, and who is assailed by dark thoughts of melancholy at the meaningless of life, alternately sinking into deep moods and rejecting his depression to embrace the rich sensations of life (wine, women and riches typically). He is cunning and clever and ruthless but his a depth that belies his simple origins, and is a marvellous physical specimen to boot.<br /> <br /> That's a Solar Exalted any day of the week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T16:14:57-07:00","id":1070369,"title":"","content":"Y'all know this is important, since Solar and I are actually agreeing about something. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T04:45:48-07:00","id":1070572,"title":"","content":"Disclaimer: I have not seen <i>Moana</i>.<br /> <br /> Modern media often hands us preternatural or completely superhuman characters and claims they are &quot;just&quot; talented people. That makes teasing apart the power level difference difficult. There are times in Conan novels when he literally kills a god. I find it difficult to demarcate whether ripping the horn off a god's head and stabbing him with it &quot;proves&quot; he is a Solar, or a Heroic Mortal with tons of XP, luck, and perhaps a forgiving ST. Other times Conan is definitely mortal. He gets captured by a small group of moderately capable mercenaries or bandits without putting up much of a fight sometimes. The Sherlock TV series has similar dichotomies. Sometimes Holmes is &quot;merely&quot; a genius, and sometimes he's a Nova with Mega-Intelligence 2 and a few Enhancements.<br /> <br /> However, both characters and their stories are the inspiration for Exalted, and Solars in particular. Arguing over whether a given character in a non-rpg-derived narrative displays enough power to qualify as a Solar strikes me as splitting hairs. Most entertainment media is not constructed via the interaction of the protagonists' character sheets with a set of game rules, after all.<br /> <br /> We, the readers of Conan, need to be entertained. Conan himself doesn't have a player who is seeking entertainment. Different desired outcomes require different inputs at times.<br /> <br /> Telling a demigod to grow the fuck up and facing an incarnation of a Primordial are Solar-level narratives, to me, even if the capabilities of the character don't match it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T04:52:56-07:00","id":1070575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070369#post1070369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y'all know this is important, since Solar and I are actually agreeing about something. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah<br /> <br /> Honestly I dunno what to feel at this point... I think I need an adult <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T05:12:16-07:00","id":1070578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1068910-moana-is-such-a-solar?p=1070575#post1070575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah<br /> <br /> Honestly I dunno what to feel at this point... I think I need an adult <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I am an adult...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}